item.text:
The chapter-level picture for 2022 is recurring repression and weak accountability, with some late-year legal reform. I did not find evidence of mass-terror scale domestic violence, but I did find repeated protest policing abuse, prosecutions for peaceful activity, and unresolved torture/disappearance problems.

